OL,3,GNEWSAFlorence Pugh hits out at weight  
OL,4,Aloss and cosmetic surgery speculation  
OL,6,F"I have never been on Ozempic. I have  
OL,7,Fnever done any face surgery," she      
OL,8,Fwrote. "And don't ever say that I      
OL,9,Fdidn't make my own nose, I've always   
OL,10,Fhad that beautiful ski slope. Even as a
OL,11,Fbaby!"                                 
OL,13,FShe added: "For the first time in my   
OL,14,Fentire career, I have had the          
OL,15,Fopportunity to be rested, to sleep, to 
OL,16,Fwake up and work out and to eat        
OL,17,Fregularly and healthily."              
